    "Neutral-blink-neutral preserves a quiet standing head/body/feet silhouette with no conspicuous size jump. Greet and left/right presentation lift the appropriate connected rounded paw; right-facing head turn is an intentional gesture, not a mirrored anatomy defect. Think tilts the head with one chin paw, aha returns upright, cheer raises both connected paws, and species pair provides small head/ear attention changes.",
    "All seven decoded recipe rows and their return to neutral were actually viewed. There is no visible extra limb, clipped tail or unintended body rescale in these discrete static neighbors."
  ],
